# Work on main

Statistico product changes belong on `main` in `E:/OneDrive/GitHub` (`avibenita/avibenita.github.io`). The live add-in is GitHub Pages from `main` at `https://statistico.live`.

Before editing:

1. Confirm the repository, branch, upstream, and `git status`.
2. Confirm this checkout is not already in use by another agent. Do not edit the same checkout at the same time.
3. For product work, start from current `origin/main`. Use another branch only when the user explicitly asks for one.
4. Leave unrelated uncommitted work in place. Do not discard it, delete branches, force-push, or reset work away.

`video-auto/independent-means` is a video line. It is 149 commits ahead of `main` and more than 150 behind. Do not merge that whole branch into `main`.

If `main` rejects a direct push, open a focused pull request into `main`. After `main` is pushed, GitHub Pages still has to publish, and Excel still has to load the new task pane URL.
